{t:"Thuluth",ar:"ثُلُث",rt:"th-l-th",m:"One third. The rule of thirds for food, drink and breath.",k:"Thuluth means one third: a third food, a third water, a third empty for breathing.",u:"Tirmidhi 2380. The name of the app's parent project."}
